# 🆚 18. Simple Analogy

Imagine an AI model is a student.

### Fine-Tuning

Fine-tuning is like sending the student to specialized training.

The student's behavior and skills are changed through additional training.

```text
Student
   ↓
Specialized Training
   ↓
Better at a Specific Task
```

